## Output Format

Return the YAML directly without Markdown code fences.

Return a YAML-serializable dictionary with this structure:
```yaml
root: "Induce ICA NOT_PROVIDED on CA-1-1"
branches:
  - category: "controller_side"
    label: "WHY THE ICA OCCURS"
    children:
      - label: "Process-model divergence"
        children:
          - label: "Process-model state diverges through FB-1-1"
            details: "FB-1-1 supplies stale state, leaving PM-1-1 inaccurate"
leaves:
  - "Process-model state diverges through FB-1-1"
```
